---
/** Home FAQ accordion + Mirik photo. */
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import faqMirik from '../../assets/img/faq-mirik.jpg';
---

<section class="section container">
  <p class="eyebrow reveal" style="margin-bottom:28px">Frequently Asked Questions</p>
  <div class="faq reveal">
    <div class="faq__media">
      {/* The one remaining JPEG on the page (332KB); astro:assets re-encodes it
          to WebP and drops the widths the 0.85fr column never needs. */}
      <Image
        src={faqMirik}
        sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 42vw"
        quality={85} widths={[480, 720, 960, 1200]}
        alt="Sunset over Mirik lake and the Darjeeling hills, with the footbridge and hillside homes"
        loading="lazy"
      />
    </div>
    <div class="faq__list">
      <div class="faq__item">
        <button class="faq__q">What we do? <span class="ico" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
        <div class="faq__a"><div class="faq__a-inner">
          <p class="lead">We design solutions that create impact.</p>
          <p>We innovate and create at the intersections of Data, Design, Technology, Communication and Research to achieve the best possible impact for our clients and partners, from evidence and strategy through to brand, product and growth.</p>
        </div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq__item">
        <button class="faq__q">Why Darjeeling <span class="ico" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
        <div class="faq__a"><div class="faq__a-inner">
          <p class="lead">Local wisdom for global impact</p>
          <p>We chose Darjeeling because creativity thrives where culture, nature, and people intersect. By building from the hills, we prove that world-class research, design, technology, and communication can emerge from regional India.</p>
        </div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq__item">
        <button class="faq__q">Who is the Founder? <span class="ico" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
        <div class="faq__a"><div class="faq__a-inner">
          <p class="lead">Farmer . Designer . Storyteller</p>
          <p><strong>Rabi</strong> / Rabiul Islam from a farming family in rural Bengal, believes that great ideas should not be limited by geography or resources. Through Studio 1947, he works at the intersection of Data and Design.</p>
        </div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq__item">
        <button class="faq__q">Our Vision <span class="ico" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
        <div class="faq__a"><div class="faq__a-inner">
          <p class="lead">Democratise innovation</p>
          <p>Our vision is to make Data, Design, and Technology accessible, affordable, and impactful for every organisation from grassroots communities and small local enterprises to governments, NGOs, and global institutions.</p>
        </div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq__item">
        <button class="faq__q">How do we get started? <span class="ico" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
        <div class="faq__a"><div class="faq__a-inner">
          <p class="lead">Simpler than you think</p>
          <p>Tell us your challenge and we'll map the solution, from first conversation to a working platform, we guide every step.</p>
        </div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq__item">
        <button class="faq__q">Do you work with international clients? <span class="ico" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
        <div class="faq__a"><div class="faq__a-inner">
          <p class="lead">From Darjeeling to the World</p>
          <p>Yes. We partner with organisations across the US, Europe, and beyond, delivering the same standards from our base in the hills.</p>
        </div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
